WeakAuras Simple Remastered

This repository is a MODIFIED version of WeakAuras WotLK 5.22.0
(https://github.com/NoM0Re/WeakAuras-WotLK), changed for the Grimfall server
(Conquest of Azeroth and classless realms) by Lidless: class/spec/talent based
features removed, per-character auras, manual role, Quick Setup and a simple
editor. It is not the official WeakAuras WotLK release.
